8 bit color rendering mode (\033[{31;37}m) with ansi escapes
    convert full 24bit color to corresponding color code

allow disabling frame via macro

how to put text on screen????
    function to put text on screen, use ansi escapes to move to correct start position of text
    enum for wordwrap LIBRENDERER_TEXT_WRAP_{CHARS,WORDS,NONE} (whether to do character/word wrapping, or none[end str if out of screen])
        corresponding macros for noprefix (TEXT_WRAP_CHARS, ...)

examples:
    snake
    raycast
    pong

